 class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the realms to discover their hidden knowledge, gain powerful spells and unlock special features that will help you conquer the In-Between.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REALM MAPS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different! Adapt your strategy to challenges and surprises you encounter in the procedurally generated realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/0996ff2dee576ce08d87511dd1dd345c.poster.avif?t=1753362970\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/0996ff2dee576ce08d87511dd1dd345c.webm?t=1753362970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/0996ff2dee576ce08d87511dd1dd345c.mp4?t=1753362970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND MUCH MORE...!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It would ruin the fun a bit if everything was revealed on this page! :) Find out how to optimize your runs and complete your objectives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>May the stars align in your favor!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/c5183fec0399185796cedabe86956ab7.webp?t=1753362970\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About SOUL FUEL GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created in 2023 by solo developer Jo Drolet, Soul Fuel Games aims to create video games filled with LIGHT and unpredictability. LHEA and the Word Spirit is the first game of this new studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head over to their website or give them a follow on social media to stay in touch and receive updates about LHEA or future games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We appreciate you &lt;3</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
